flowchart TD
    A[SSH login event arrives] --> B{Password attempt failed?}

    B -- No --> C[Keep successful-login context]
    B -- Yes --> D[Capture user, source IP, and time]

    D --> E[Group failures by user and source]
    E --> F{At least 5 failures in 120 seconds?}

    F -- No --> G[No alert]
    F -- Yes --> H{Source already expected?}

    H -- No --> I[Raise suspicious authentication alert]
    H -- Yes --> J{Successful login within 60 seconds?}

    J -- Yes --> K[Do not raise high-priority alert]
    J -- No --> I

    I --> L[SOC reviews the activity]
